{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And the Negev.</b> The land of the south. Another interpretation — the cave of Machpelah, as it is said: ״וַיַּעֲלוּ בַנֶּגֶב וַיָּבֹא עַד חֶבְרוֹן״ (Numbers 13)." "<b>And the plain.</b> He showed him Solomon casting the vessels of the Temple, as it is said (I Kings 7): ״בְּכִכַּר הַיַּרְדֵּן יְצָקָם הַמֶּלֶךְ בְּמַעֲבֵה הָאֲדָמָה״ (Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:57.231121779Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}